  "place": "Changban, Jing Province",
  "blurb": [
    "Liu Bei would not leave the people of Xiangyang behind, and the people would not leave him. Tens of thousands trail his column toward Jiangling at ten li a day, and Cao Cao has sent his light riders to run it down.",
    "The column has just crossed the Changban bridge. Behind it the stream is the only wall in the country; ahead lies a long marsh, and the south edge of the map is the road to safety. Get Liu Bei and three more of your company off that edge. Fight only as long as it buys the road, and remember that reeds burn."
