      "phase": "start",
      "kind": "message",
      "text": "Cao Cao's light riders have covered three hundred li in a day and a night. Behind the column the Changban bridge is the only dry crossing for miles."
    },
    {
      "round": 5,
      "phase": "start",
      "kind": "message",
      "text": "Dust on the northern road, thicker than before: the infantry and the bowmen are coming up behind the horse."
